{"1314430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Rooms", "steam_appid": 1314430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4816750], "detailed_description": "<h1>Still Rooms Demo Available!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cozy demo of <strong>Still Rooms</strong> is now available on Steam! 🏡✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cozy world of decorating and transform empty rooms into warm, personal spaces. Arrange furniture, experiment with different layouts, complete decorating tasks, and discover how satisfying it can be to turn total emptiness into a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives you a first look at the core gameplay and the relaxing atmosphere we are creating for the full version of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would love for you to give it a try and share your thoughts with us. Every playthrough, comment, and piece of feedback helps us improve Still Rooms as we continue working toward release.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create beautiful spaces, express your creativity, and turn empty rooms into cozy dream interiors in this relaxing isometric pixel-art decoration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and furnish a variety of unique locations, each with its own atmosphere, style, and personality. From warm rustic homes and modern apartments to retro 80’s interiors, compact student rooms, futuristic spaceships, and peaceful rooftop hideaways — every level offers a completely different decorating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/c1de9f25024f742960dfd4d9a88f876f.poster.avif?t=1785874158\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/c1de9f25024f742960dfd4d9a88f876f.webm?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/c1de9f25024f742960dfd4d9a88f876f.mp4?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of furniture pieces, decorations, and accessories to build spaces that feel truly your own. Mix styles, experiment with layouts, and discover countless ways to personalize every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete dynamic decorating tasks, unlock new possibilities, and create interiors ranging from clean minimalism to colorful cluttered comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to carefully optimize every corner or simply relax and decorate at your own pace, the game offers a cozy and satisfying creative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/fc16e1d6dc76bb482155ccec41c75c89.poster.avif?t=1785874158\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/fc16e1d6dc76bb482155ccec41c75c89.webm?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/fc16e1d6dc76bb482155ccec41c75c89.mp4?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique themed locations to decorate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy isometric pixel-art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of furniture and decoration items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic task and objective system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple room types and layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative freedom with endless combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and satisfying gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate rooftops, apartments, houses, and even a spaceship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who love cozy games, interior design, creativity, and relaxing atmosphere-driven experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/65706a505ebcf6a4b8c7bde069fa1199.poster.avif?t=1785874158\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/65706a505ebcf6a4b8c7bde069fa1199.webm?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/65706a505ebcf6a4b8c7bde069fa1199.mp4?t=1785874158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create beautiful spaces, express your creativity, and turn empty rooms into cozy dream interiors in this relaxing isometric pixel-art decoration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and furnish a variety of unique locations, each with its own atmosphere, style, and personality. From warm rustic homes and modern apartments to retro 80’s interiors, compact student rooms, futuristic spaceships, and peaceful rooftop hideaways — every level offers a completely different decorating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1314430/extras/c1de9f25024f742960dfd4d9a88f876f.poster.avif?t=1785874158\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st